Scope of this notice

The copyright above covers the original work in this repository: its
source code, its tests, and its documentation.

It does not cover, and no ownership is claimed over, the hydraulic laws,
formulas, constants and other facts those documents state, nor the
published sources the model is compiled from — the CGBVP 2019 manual,
IFSTA material, the Colorado DFPC chart and the like. Those belong to
their respective authors and publishers. They are used here as public
reference sources, and every value names its source in
`src/hydraulics/references.ts` and `docs/MODEL.md`.

What is claimed for the model is the credit for compiling it from freely
available public sources, not ownership of that material.
